comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-22T11:28:29.622Z",pi-agent,"Implemented update, comment, and close in the Rust CLI and SDK (src/mutation.rs, src/history.rs). History records now carry item_hash_version 2, canonical ITEM_METADATA_KEY_ORDER patch diffs, and argv-derived agent_provenance roles; create was upgraded to the same v2 record shape with its recorded fixture regenerated against published pm 2026.8.21 bytes. New recorded-fixture suite tests/mutation_contract.rs proves byte equality for create/update/comment/status-update/close item and history bytes at SDK and black-box CLI level."
